<title>BELGIUM: EU to decide on Italian state railway guarantees.</title>
<headline>EU to decide on Italian state railway guarantees.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eurostat, the European Union's statistical office, said on Monday that it would address the accounting treatment of Italian state railway guarantees later this month.</p>
<p>&quot;State guarantees, the pre-financing of public works by the private sector, the euro tax, export and railway guarantees, all of these issues will be decided by the end of the month,&quot; a Eurostat official told a news conference.</p>
<p>Officials said they hoped to have a final reading on these accounting issues by February 22.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom 32 2 287 6830</p>
</text>
